<%--
Bf_Plain - the common case: no on_stop(), no 'stop' listeners, no on_load().
_stop() used to take a fast path for exactly this component, which skipped the
_Component_Stopped class and the parent de-registration (audit bug 22).
--%>
<Define:Bf_Plain class="bf-plain">
  <span>plain</span>
</Define:Bf_Plain>
